{"unit_id":"Vergil-long__dsh-custom-font#feature-1","repo":"Vergil-long/dsh-custom-font","commit":"373fd28a3618129d72a23e81bfec1ff31e044db4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH自定义字体插件的功能「调整界面文字」：在设置页分别配置正文、标题、代码和界面文字的字体、字号与字重。打开设置中的自定义字体面板后修改选项，客户端生成 CSS 即时应用。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:655-657","client/client.js:663-677","client/client.js:1275-1290"]}
