{"unit_id":"Vergil-long__dsh-custom-font#caveat-1","repo":"Vergil-long/dsh-custom-font","commit":"373fd28a3618129d72a23e81bfec1ff31e044db4","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"DSH自定义字体插件会把设置写入本机 DSH 用户目录下的 dsh-custom-font/settings.json；设置请求通过宿主本地接口处理。Windows 系统字体列表读取仅在 Windows 上可用。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/config.js:20-35","lib/index.js:184-224","lib/index.js:74-76"]}
